{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>that sprang up after them</b> — It is not that he saw them sprouting, for he saw only ears that were already formed. Rather, it is as though it said צָמְחוּ אַחֲרֵיהֶן (\"they sprang up after them\"), and Scripture seized upon this expression to inform us that as soon as he saw the good ones, he saw the bad ones that came up after them, for he perceived a sign of immediacy in all of them."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:42:29.436410358Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}